>> numbers := ['1,2,3'] hlukanisa: [','].
Okuphumayo bhala: ['I got: '] + numbers inani + [' numbers.'],umugqa-omusha.
{ :i Okuphumayo bhala: ['number #'] + i + [':'] + (numbers indawo: i), umugqa-omusha.} × 3.
>> beverages := ['Tea Or Coffee Or Milk Or Orange Juice Or Water'].
beverages := beverages hlukanisa: [' Or '].
Okuphumayo bhala: ['We serve'], umugqa-omusha.
{ :i Okuphumayo bhala: ['->'] + (beverages indawo: i), umugqa-omusha. } × (beverages inani).
Okuphumayo bhala: (beverages hlanganisa: [',']), umugqa-omusha.
Okuphumayo bhala: (numbers hlanganisa: ['||']).
